#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "568592"
msgid "And here she is…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "568784"
msgid "Can you hear me!? What happened!?\nWe can't monitor the situation,\nso tell us wh―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "569524"
msgid "Don't worry, it won't hurt.\nThis poison was made for you; the highest form\nof love, made just for you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "570980"
msgid "You only love the figure of #C236196003#FAMILY\n#GIVEN#CDEF. I shall never hand over my Darling\nto you!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "571888"
msgid "#C236196003#SVT#CDEF is right."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "571924"
msgid "#C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF's love is based on her one-sided values."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "572272"
msgid "That's―――\nwhat I've been saying all along!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "572324"
msgid "What?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "572512"
msgid "#C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF glares at me with a coldhearted smile."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "572588"
msgid "#C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF glares at #C236196003Archer#CDEF with a coldhearted smile."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "572684"
msgid "…now I see what makes her different from #C236196003Passionlip#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "572756"
msgid "All #C236196003Lip#CDEF wanted was for others to love her.\nBut this #C000246204Alter Ego#CDEF wants to wholeheartedly love only herself."
msgstr ""

#. popupStd_line2
msgctxt "573900"
msgid "#C000246204Run as fast as you can#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "573964"
msgid "The fun hunt ends here.\nWell―――fate has caught up to you, hasn't it?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "574036"
msgid "Sh-she caught up to us…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "574380"
msgid "#C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF's spikes pierce #C236196003#SVT#CDEF's body."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "575008"
msgid "…#C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF's heels click against the ground."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "575452"
msgid "So―――sleep now like a doll.\nYou're my possession.\nMy little doll."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "575728"
msgid "This is the beginning of hell for #C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "575888"
msgid "Guh…!\nNot yet, not yet…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "575920"
msgid "#C236196003Archer#CDEF reanimates his failing body."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "576208"
msgid "#C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF's spike pierces my body."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "576504"
msgid "Damn you…\nDamn you, #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF―――!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "576760"
msgid "Guh… bgh…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "576860"
msgid "Now you belong to me, #C236196003Archer#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "577000"
msgid "…I hear heavy heels click against the ground…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "577056"
msgid "…I'm sorry, #C236196003Archer#CDEF…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "577628"
msgid "#C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF……!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "578284"
msgid "Then we'll just prepare for the worst\nand stall her as long as possible!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "578360"
msgid "But first, ahem…\nHey! You, pervert over there!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "578892"
msgid "I enjoyed this hunt.\nIt made me realize what I truly want to do."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "579636"
msgid "Huh―――kya! What―――!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "579668"
msgid "#C236196003BB#CDEF……!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "579780"
msgid "!?\nNo, my rule was reversed instantly―――\nWhy are you aiding them, #C236196003BB#CDEF!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "579872"
msgid "I didn't side with #[him][her]#.\nWhat I did was hinder YOU, #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "580760"
msgid "…she voided the #C000246204SE.RA.PH#CDEF system in an instant?\nShe really has reached god-level, hasn't she?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "581632"
msgid "Just how high level is she!?\nHow many Servants did she rob of experience!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "581792"
msgid "#C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF! Just how many Servants\ndid you absorb with that drain skill…!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "582564"
msgid "Wh―level 999…!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "582592"
msgid "This goes beyond cheating…!\nShe's so greedy, she stole experience from Servants,\nNPCs, and Masters until the level cap!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "583560"
msgid "Circuit connected!\nAre you okay, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "583624"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF…!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "583696"
msgid "Sorry, no can do!\nJust run, #C236196003#NICK#CDEF!\nThe correct route is on your right!"
msgstr ""

